{"availability":"available","full":"mdashraful24/fieldnexus-frontend-l2b7a7","name":"fieldnexus-frontend-l2b7a7","description":"Field Nexus is a B2B multi-vendor field service management platform connecting customers, vendors, and technicians. It manages service requests, approvals, technician assignments, scheduling, job completion, feedback, and bKash payments/refunds through role-based dashboards. The platform also includes a public website and vendor directory.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T08:40:23Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:02:18Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fieldnexus-frontend.vercel.app","topics":["bkash","jwt","lucide-react","nextjs16","oauth2","shadcn-ui","sonner","tailwindcss","tanstack-query","typescript","vercel","zod"],"demo":"https://fieldnexus-frontend.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.714Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.714Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.714Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:04.714Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Field Nexus is a B2B multi-vendor field service management platform. It sits between a large enterprise that needs technicians dispatched to customer homes and offices, and the network of subcontractor vendor companies that actually employ those technicians.","The frontend is the complete web client for the platform: a public marketing site and vendor directory, a full authentication system, and four role-based dashboards that manage the entire lifecycle of a field service job — from a customer's service request, through admin approval and technician assignment, to completion, feedback, and bKash payment/refund.","Instead of a company manually juggling hundreds of technicians with phone calls and paper files, Field Nexus provides a single hub where jobs are created, assigned, tracked, completed, and paid — end to end."],"featu